OL,3,AHealey acknowledges high government
OL,4,Aborrowing costs but won't be drawn on
OL,5,Atax changes in Budget
OL,6,
OL,7,FTaking questions, Healey doesn't say
OL,8,Fwhether he will raise taxes come
OL,9,FOctober, telling reporters: "If I
OL,10,Frespond to speculation now that will
OL,11,Fonly fuel more speculation"
OL,13,FDuring the speech, Healey also confirms
OL,14,Fplans to allocate #150m to fast-growing
OL,15,Ffirms in northern England and to create
OL,16,Fthe "northern 500", bringing together
OL,17,F"ambitious mid-sized businesses" in a
OL,18,Fgroup led by mayors
